---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Sift" description="Clean up your LinkedIn feed. Hide ads, filter keywords, unfollow inline, and flag suspicious job listings. Open source.">
  <main class="jl-page grid-page">
    <a href="/" class="back-link" data-i18n="nav.back">&larr; Back</a>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="jl-header">
      <img src="/images/joblens-icon.png" alt="Sift icon" class="jl-logo" />
      <div>
        <div class="jl-title-row">
          <h1>Sift</h1>
          <div class="jl-version-wrap">
            <button class="jl-version-btn" id="jl-changelog-toggle" aria-label="View changelog">v2.5</button>
            <div class="jl-changelog-backdrop" id="jl-changelog-backdrop" hidden></div>
            <div class="jl-changelog-popup" id="jl-changelog-popup" hidden>
              <div class="jl-changelog-header">
                <span class="jl-changelog-title" data-i18n="joblens.changelogTitle">Changelog</span>
                <button class="jl-changelog-close" id="jl-changelog-close" aria-label="Close changelog">&times;</button>
              </div>
              <div id="jl-changelog-content"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="jl-feedback-wrap">
            <button class="jl-feedback-btn" id="jl-feedback-toggle" data-i18n="joblens.feedback" aria-label="Send feedback">Feedback</button>
            <div class="jl-feedback-backdrop" id="jl-feedback-backdrop" hidden></div>
            <div class="jl-feedback-popup" id="jl-feedback-popup" hidden>
              <div class="jl-feedback-header">
                <span class="jl-feedback-title" data-i18n="joblens.feedbackTitle">Any Suggestion? Pls!!!</span>
                <button class="jl-feedback-close" id="jl-feedback-close" aria-label="Close feedback form">&times;</button>
              </div>
              <form id="jl-feedback-form">
                <textarea name="message" required rows="4" class="jl-feedback-textarea" id="jl-feedback-textarea" placeholder="Bugs, ideas, anything..."></textarea>
                <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
                <button type="submit" class="jl-feedback-submit" id="jl-feedback-submit" data-i18n="joblens.feedbackSend">Send</button>
              </form>
              <p class="jl-feedback-success" id="jl-feedback-success" hidden data-i18n="joblens.feedbackSent">Thanks! Feedback sent.</p>
              <p class="jl-feedback-error" id="jl-feedback-error" hidden data-i18n="joblens.feedbackError">Failed to send. Try again?</p>
            </div>
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="jl-subtitle" data-i18n="joblens.subtitle">
          Take back a LinkedIn worth your time.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Inspiration -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2 data-i18n="joblens.inspirationTitle">Inspiration</h2>
      <p data-i18n="joblens.inspiration1">LinkedIn is great at surfacing relevant jobs and content. But the experience? Ads everywhere, "Suggested" posts from strangers, reposted job listings, no way to tell if a role sponsors visas without clicking through. Your feed is half noise, and your job search is mostly triage.</p>
      <p data-i18n="joblens.inspiration2">Sift exists because the platform is good but the workflow is broken. It cleans up both sides of LinkedIn: your feed and your job search.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Feed Cleanup -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2 data-i18n="joblens.feedTitle">Feed Cleanup</h2>
      <p data-i18n="joblens.feedDesc">Sift automatically hides ads, suggested posts, and recommended content from your LinkedIn feed. One-click Unfollow appears inline on every post — no digging through menus.</p>
      <ul class="jl-features">
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.hideAds"><strong>Hide Ads</strong>: removes Promoted posts automatically</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.hideSuggested"><strong>Hide Suggested & Recommended</strong>: filters non-connection noise</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.hideStrangers"><strong>Hide Strangers</strong>: filter posts from non-connections</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.unfollow"><strong>One-click Unfollow</strong>: hover any post to unfollow the author directly</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.autoCollapse"><strong>Auto-collapse</strong>: "You unfollowed X" confirmation cards collapse automatically</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.hideSidebar"><strong>Hide Sidebar</strong>: remove LinkedIn News and footer clutter</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.keywords"><strong>Keyword Filter</strong>: define custom keywords to hide matching posts</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.badge"><strong>Live Badge</strong>: floating counter shows how many posts have been filtered</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.iconBadge"><strong>Icon Badge</strong>: extension icon shows the filtered count at a glance</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.polls"><strong>Hide Polls</strong>: filter out LinkedIn polls from your feed</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.pause"><strong>Shift+J</strong>: pause/resume all filters instantly</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Profile & Network -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2 data-i18n="joblens.profileTitle">Profile & Network</h2>
      <p data-i18n="joblens.profileDesc">Sift also cleans up your profile and My Network pages — hiding sidebar clutter, ads, analytics you don't need, and game promotions.</p>
      <ul class="jl-features">
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.profileSidebar"><strong>Hide Profile Sidebar</strong>: removes ads, "People you may know", and "You might like" panels</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.profileAnalytics"><strong>Hide Analytics</strong>: hides profile views, impressions, and search appearances</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.networkAds"><strong>Hide Network Ads</strong>: removes Promoted ads from My Network</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.networkGame"><strong>Hide Game Promo</strong>: removes LinkedIn game promotions</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Job Search -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2 data-i18n="joblens.jobsTitle">Job Search Intelligence</h2>
      <p data-i18n="joblens.jobsDesc">On LinkedIn's job search results page, Sift flags suspicious listings so you skip the ones not worth your time.</p>
      <div class="jl-flags">
        <div class="jl-flag">
          <span class="jl-flag-badge" style="background:var(--color-rose)">Reposted</span>
          <span class="jl-flag-desc" data-i18n="joblens.flag.reposted">Job has been reposted — stale listing</span>
        </div>
        <div class="jl-flag">
          <span class="jl-flag-badge" style="background:var(--color-rose)">Applied</span>
          <span class="jl-flag-desc" data-i18n="joblens.flag.applied">You already applied to this one</span>
        </div>
        <div class="jl-flag">
          <span class="jl-flag-badge" style="background:var(--color-rose)">No Sponsor</span>
          <span class="jl-flag-desc" data-i18n="joblens.flag.noSponsor">Description says visa sponsorship not available</span>
        </div>
        <div class="jl-flag">
          <span class="jl-flag-badge" style="background:var(--color-rose)">Unpaid</span>
          <span class="jl-flag-desc" data-i18n="joblens.flag.unpaid">Volunteer or unpaid position</span>
        </div>
        <div class="jl-flag">
          <span class="jl-flag-badge" style="background:var(--color-rose)">Skipped Co.</span>
          <span class="jl-flag-desc" data-i18n="joblens.flag.skippedCo">Company on your skip list</span>
        </div>
        <div class="jl-flag">
          <span class="jl-flag-badge" style="background:var(--color-rose)">Skipped Title</span>
          <span class="jl-flag-desc" data-i18n="joblens.flag.skippedTitle">Title contains a keyword you're avoiding</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- See It in Action -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2 data-i18n="joblens.demoTitle">See It in Action</h2>
      <div class="jl-screenshots">
        <figure class="jl-screenshot-figure">
          <img src="/images/joblens-dim-off.webp" alt="Sift badges on LinkedIn job cards" class="jl-screenshot" />
          <figcaption data-i18n="joblens.cap.badges">Badges flag issues at a glance</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="jl-screenshot-figure">
          <img src="/images/joblens-dim-on.webp" alt="Sift dim mode fading flagged cards" class="jl-screenshot" />
          <figcaption data-i18n="joblens.cap.dim">Dim mode fades flagged cards</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Get Started -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2 data-i18n="joblens.startTitle">Get Started</h2>
      <ol class="jl-steps">
        <li data-i18n="joblens.step1">Install from the <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/ainpeagpaoafcblhcebbakofagiocooa?utm_source=kunli_website" class="jl-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chrome Web Store</a></li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.step2">Visit <strong>LinkedIn</strong> — your feed is automatically cleaned up</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.step3">Go to <strong>Jobs &rarr; Search Results</strong> — cards are auto-flagged</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.step4">Click the <strong>Sift icon</strong> to adjust settings, view stats, or export data</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.step5">Hover any post to <strong>Unfollow</strong> the author with one click</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <!-- How It Works -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2 data-i18n="joblens.howTitle">How It Works</h2>
      <div class="jl-pipeline">
        <div class="jl-step">
          <span class="jl-step-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="jl-step-label" data-i18n="joblens.pipe.detect">Detect</span>
        </div>
        <span class="jl-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        <div class="jl-step">
          <span class="jl-step-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="jl-step-label" data-i18n="joblens.pipe.badge">Badge</span>
        </div>
        <span class="jl-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        <div class="jl-step">
          <span class="jl-step-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="22 3 2 3 10 12.46 10 19 14 21 14 12.46 22 3"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="jl-step-label" data-i18n="joblens.pipe.filter">Filter</span>
        </div>
        <span class="jl-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        <div class="jl-step">
          <span class="jl-step-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="jl-step-label" data-i18n="joblens.pipe.focus">Focus</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p data-i18n="joblens.howDesc">Reads page content directly in the browser. No external servers, no API calls. Everything runs locally. Your preferences are stored via Chrome's local storage.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Privacy -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2 data-i18n="joblens.privacyTitle">Privacy</h2>
      <p data-i18n="joblens.privacyDesc">Sift runs entirely in your browser. No data is collected, transmitted, or stored externally. All preferences and stats stay on your device.</p>
      <a href="/sift/privacy" class="jl-link" style="font-size:var(--fs-xs)" data-i18n="joblens.privacyLink">Full privacy policy &rarr;</a>
    </section>

    <!-- Open Source -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2 data-i18n="joblens.openSourceTitle">Open Source</h2>
      <p data-i18n="joblens.openSourceDesc">Sift is open source under the MIT license. You can read every line of code, verify the privacy claims yourself, or contribute improvements.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="jl-cta">
      <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/ainpeagpaoafcblhcebbakofagiocooa?utm_source=kunli_website" class="jl-store-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <svg class="jl-store-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><line x1="21.17" y1="8" x2="12" y2="8"/><line x1="3.95" y1="6.06" x2="8.54" y2="14"/><line x1="10.88" y1="21.94" x2="15.46" y2="14"/></svg>
        <span>Chrome Web Store</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/liuyixiaohu/sift" class="jl-github-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <svg class="jl-store-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0 0 24 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/></svg>
        <span>GitHub</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Lightbox -->
    <dialog class="jl-lightbox" id="jl-lightbox">
      <img id="jl-lightbox-img" alt="" />
    </dialog>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import { track } from '../../utils/analytics';
  import { siftChangelog } from '../../data/siftChangelog';

  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', () => {
    // --- Lightbox ---
    const dialog = document.getElementById('jl-lightbox') as HTMLDialogElement | null;
    const lbImg = document.getElementById('jl-lightbox-img') as HTMLImageElement | null;
    if (dialog && lbImg) {
      document.querySelectorAll('.jl-screenshot').forEach(img => {
        img.addEventListener('click', () => {
          lbImg.src = (img as HTMLImageElement).src;
          lbImg.alt = (img as HTMLImageElement).alt;
          dialog.showModal();
        });
      });
      dialog.addEventListener('click', () => dialog.close());
    }

    // --- CTA tracking ---
    document.querySelector('.jl-store-link')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      track('joblens_cta_click');
    });

    // --- Changelog ---
    const clToggle = document.getElementById('jl-changelog-toggle');
    const clPopup = document.getElementById('jl-changelog-popup');
    const clBackdrop = document.getElementById('jl-changelog-backdrop');
    const clClose = document.getElementById('jl-changelog-close');
    const clContent = document.getElementById('jl-changelog-content');

    function renderChangelog() {
      if (!clContent) return;
      const lang = (document.documentElement.dataset.lang as 'en' | 'zh') || 'en';
      clContent.innerHTML = siftChangelog.map(r => `
        <div class="jl-changelog-release">
          <div class="jl-changelog-version">${r.version}</div>
          <p class="jl-changelog-why">${r.why[lang]}</p>
          <ul class="jl-changelog-list">
            ${r.changes[lang].map(c => `<li>${c}</li>`).join('')}
          </ul>
        </div>
      `).join('');
    }
    renderChangelog();
    document.addEventListener('lang-change', renderChangelog);

    function toggleChangelog() {
      if (clPopup) clPopup.hidden = !clPopup.hidden;
      if (clBackdrop) clBackdrop.hidden = !clBackdrop.hidden;
    }
    function closeChangelog() {
      if (clPopup) clPopup.hidden = true;
      if (clBackdrop) clBackdrop.hidden = true;
    }

    clToggle?.addEventListener('click', toggleChangelog);
    clBackdrop?.addEventListener('click', closeChangelog);
    clClose?.addEventListener('click', closeChangelog);

    // --- Feedback ---
    const fbToggle = document.getElementById('jl-feedback-toggle');
    const fbPopup = document.getElementById('jl-feedback-popup');
    const fbBackdrop = document.getElementById('jl-feedback-backdrop');
    const fbClose = document.getElementById('jl-feedback-close');
    const form = document.getElementById('jl-feedback-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
    const submitBtn = document.getElementById('jl-feedback-submit');
    const successMsg = document.getElementById('jl-feedback-success');
    const errorMsg = document.getElementById('jl-feedback-error');

    function openFeedback() {
      if (!fbPopup || !fbBackdrop) return;
      fbPopup.hidden = false;
      fbBackdrop.hidden = false;
      if (successMsg) successMsg.hidden = true;
      if (errorMsg) errorMsg.hidden = true;
      if (form) form.hidden = false;
    }

    function closeFeedback() {
      if (fbPopup) fbPopup.hidden = true;
      if (fbBackdrop) fbBackdrop.hidden = true;
    }

    fbToggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (fbPopup?.hidden) openFeedback();
      else closeFeedback();
    });
    fbBackdrop?.addEventListener('click', closeFeedback);
    fbClose?.addEventListener('click', closeFeedback);

    form?.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      if (!submitBtn || !form) return;
      submitBtn.setAttribute('disabled', '');
      submitBtn.textContent = '...';
      if (errorMsg) errorMsg.hidden = true;

      try {
        const res = await fetch('https://formspree.io/f/xreykpga', {
          method: 'POST',
          body: new FormData(form),
          headers: { Accept: 'application/json' },
        });
        if (!res.ok) throw new Error();
        form.hidden = true;
        if (successMsg) successMsg.hidden = false;
      } catch {
        if (errorMsg) errorMsg.hidden = false;
      } finally {
        submitBtn.removeAttribute('disabled');
      }
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .jl-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .jl-logo {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .jl-title-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .jl-header h1 {
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--color-rose);
  }

  .jl-subtitle {
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }

  /* Sections */
  .section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .section h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .section h3 {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .section p {
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  /* Flag badges */
  .jl-flags {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .jl-flag {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .jl-flag-badge {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.15em 0.6em;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    color: #fff;
    white-space: nowrap;
    min-width: 5.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .jl-flag-desc {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  /* Screenshots */
  .jl-screenshots {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .jl-screenshots {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .jl-screenshot-figure {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .jl-screenshot {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    cursor: zoom-in;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .jl-screenshot:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .jl-screenshot-figure figcaption {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: var(--text-light);
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }

  /* Pipeline */
  .jl-pipeline {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .jl-step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .jl-step-icon {
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--color-rose);
  }

  .jl-step-icon svg {
    width: 1.4rem;
    height: 1.4rem;
  }

  .jl-step-label {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .jl-arrow {
    color: var(--text-light);
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  /* Steps */
  .jl-steps {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .jl-steps li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .jl-steps li::marker {
    color: var(--color-rose);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .jl-steps code {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    padding: 0.1em 0.4em;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .jl-steps strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .jl-link {
    color: var(--color-rose);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .jl-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* Features list */
  .jl-features {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .jl-features li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .jl-features li::marker {
    color: var(--color-rose);
  }

  .jl-features strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .jl-features code {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    padding: 0.1em 0.4em;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  /* CTA */
  .jl-cta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
